          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimo kusikabongu m’ulweku, man m’uluga, man ma kwar ngbo, ku bongu ma nwang’ ma ber m’awia: ku kerubi, ma tic pa jabodho ma riek, etime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimo mbegi ang’wen pire mi yendulu, man emwonogi ku mola ma kwar: golne en e mi mola ma kwar; man ethiedho igi wer ang’wen mi mola ma tar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimo voi mi dhugola mi Hema, m’ulweku, man m’uluga, ku ma kwar ngbo, man bongu ma nwang’ ma ber m’awia, ma tic pa jakwoc mi ruko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
